---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Battery Carbon Footprint (PCF) & LCA Engine | EU DPP Provider"
  description="Automated Product Carbon Footprint (PCF) engine compliant with EU PEFCR rules and ISO 14040/44 for battery life-cycle assessment."
>
  <div class="py-16 sm:py-24 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="eyebrow-pill mb-3 mx-auto">PCF & LCA Automation Engine</div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        PEFCR-Compliant Battery <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
        <span class="text-cyan-600">Carbon Footprint Engine</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        The EU Battery Regulation mandates strict lifecycle carbon accounting across 4 lifecycle stages: Raw Material Acquisition, Battery Manufacturing, Distribution, and Recycling.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-6 flex justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="mailto:info@eudppprovider.com" class="neo-btn-primary">
          Contact Carbon Engineering Desk →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Lifecycle Stages Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-16">
      
      <div class="neo-surface p-6">
        <div class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-cyan-600 mb-1">Stage 01</div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Raw Material Acquisition</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
          Cradle-to-gate mining and chemical precursor extraction (Cathode, Anode, Electrolyte, Separator) with ecoinvent / Gabi emission factor integration.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="neo-surface p-6">
        <div class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-cyan-600 mb-1">Stage 02</div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Battery Manufacturing</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
          Primary energy consumption, cleanroom electricity mix, cell electrode coating, module formation, and pack assembly line emissions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="neo-surface p-6">
        <div class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-cyan-600 mb-1">Stage 03</div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Distribution & Transport</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
          Intercontinental sea freight, domestic European road logistics, and warehouse staging carbon calculation per battery unit.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="neo-surface p-6">
        <div class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-green-700 mb-1">Stage 04</div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">End-of-Life & Recycling</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
          Circular economy credits, hydrometallurgical recycling efficiencies, and avoided burden offsets for reclaimed precious metals.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Technical Feature Details -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto mb-16">
      
      <div class="neo-surface p-8">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Automated PEFCR Data Modeling</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Our calculation engine strictly applies Product Environmental Footprint Category Rules (PEFCR) specific to EV and industrial batteries, eliminating manual LCA spreadsheet errors.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-600">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-cyan-600 font-bold">✓</span> Direct connector to factory energy meters & MES bills of materials</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-cyan-600 font-bold">✓</span> Supplier portal for upstream precursor emission declaration</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-cyan-600 font-bold">✓</span> Automated generation of EU Carbon Footprint Declaration (CFD)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="neo-surface p-8">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Notified Body (NB) Verification Bridge</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Seamless export of auditable calculation packages for third-party verification bodies (TÜV Rheinland, TÜV SÜD, SGS, DEKRA), slashing certification lead time.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-600">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-green-700 font-bold">✓</span> Pre-formatted audit packages with full data provenance trace</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-green-700 font-bold">✓</span> Tamper-evident cryptographic timestamps for activity data</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-green-700 font-bold">✓</span> Automated class rating derivation (Class A / B / C benchmarks)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Action Card -->
    <div class="neo-surface p-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Request PCF Carbon Footprint Scoping</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 max-w-lg mx-auto">
        Speak with our certified LCA engineers to evaluate your battery cell or pack carbon accounting readiness.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-5">
        <a href="mailto:info@eudppprovider.com" class="neo-btn-primary inline-flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>Email: info@eudppprovider.com</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
